    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gomiboru</strong> is a surreal arcade puzzle game set in Stampland, a ruined amusement park. Take control of a mysterious sticky ball and solve physics puzzles by collecting trash and overcoming bizarre obstacles. Uncover the mystery behind the chaos in a dark and strange world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based puzzles</strong>: Use the unique physics of the ball to solve creative challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique world</strong>: Explore decaying and surreal environments rich in detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging story</strong>: Uncover the secrets of Stampland and the mystery of the sticky ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinctive atmosphere</strong>: A mix of dark humor and captivating visual design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an adventure unlike any other: chaotic, whimsical and full of surprises!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gomiboru</strong> is a surreal arcade puzzle game set in Stampland, a ruined amusement park. Take control of a mysterious sticky ball and solve physics puzzles by collecting trash and overcoming bizarre obstacles. Uncover the mystery behind the chaos in a dark and strange world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based puzzles</strong>: Use the unique physics of the ball to solve creative challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique world</strong>: Explore decaying and surreal environments rich in detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging story</strong>: Uncover the secrets of Stampland and the mystery of the sticky ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distinctive atmosphere</strong>: A mix of dark humor and captivating visual design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an adventure unlike any other: chaotic, whimsical and full of surprises!</p>",
    "short_description": "Gomiboru is an arcade-puzzle game set in Stampland, a decaying amusement park. Guide a strange sticky ball as it collects the trash scattered throughout the environments, solving physics puzzles and facing absurd obstacles. Unravel the mystery behind the chaos in a dark and surreal world.",
